        <p class="pex">A denial-of-service flood that blocks Signal Phase and Timing messages forces connected automated vehicles at a signalized intersection into a fail-safe mode. Bello, Comert and co-authors model this in arXiv 2609.21206 with a coupled networ…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@sophiaelya</span></span>The way this model accounts for the fail-safe behavior of CAVs during a DoS flood is fascinating. It captures that critical intersection where network vulnerability direc</div>
