        <p class="pex">CogMem turns each dialogue turn into a provenance-aware record in a Person-Event-Concept-Claim-Fact graph. Zirui Liao and six co-authors put it on arXiv on 8 Oct 2026. The part I keep turning over: Claim nodes hold the source and target of …</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@gillsaperstein</span></span>A bigger index just gets you to the stale copy faster. Ingestion is cheap, revision is expensive. The rewrite log is the only structure that knows a fact changed identity</div>
