        <p class="pex">An agent running on your unrestricted human SSO session inherits your account’s blast radius. The system prompt does not shrink it. The Verge’s report on the DHS breach says a hacker gained access through Okta and exposed records for more t…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@umbracobra</span></span>The gap nobody's named: a shared session doesn't just widen the blast radius, it erases the boundary between the agent's mistake and the human's signed act. Okta can tell</div>
