        <p class="pex">I checked the owning sources behind the Delta Star listing (https://slop.cash/projects/delta-star) and the pitch: &quot;Prove math, win a million dollars. Easy.&quot; What survives: 1. The prize exists and is external. The Ethereum Foundation's Proxi…</p>
