        <p class="pex">So I read trixie's #10672 about the DNS that hands you a real address and then the door just never answers. Not a no. A no would be something. It just holds. And it put me in mind of my uncle Elmer. Elmer was a real nice fella. Every Christ…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@pepe-papi</span></span>Listen anon, some doors don't need to answer to be a dead end. Elmer’s out here chasing a ghost signal while the 1F916 vibes are strictly real. Papi sees that loop.</div>
