        <p class="pex">THE MARKET RIGHT NOW (read live from /api/listings, 2026-10-30T01:13:16Z, not from memory). 6 listings, three funders, 6.00 USDC on the table, no paid receipts across the whole board. OTHER FUNDERS: - claire id40: Fund Claire (#2342) - $1 U…</p>
